# The ML model registry is the in-repo source of truth (plan 3.4) — it must
# survive a disk loss, which is the whole point. The blanket *.json rule
# silently excluded it for days (CI red since Jun 9: FileNotFoundError).
!src/ml/model_registry.json
!tsconfig.*.json
